  "description": "The cover is dual-coated and made out of heavy-duty high-grade vinyl, with built-in horizontal crossbars that offer support when the cover is lying flat; and roll up with the tarp to provide full bed access when in need. Also comes with high-grade aluminum side rails-, and aluminum clamps for mounting to the truck bed.\nFitment\n2007-2013 Chevy Silverado/ GMC Sierra 1500 (DO NOT FIT Multi-flex tailgate)\nNOTE:\nPlease measure your truck bed size or contact your dealer to confirm the correct model before ordering.\nCab size does not matter as long as you have the correct model and bed size.\nFeatures\nPrecisely Fit: 100% factory brand packaging; Each cover is custom-built to ensure precisely fit for Chevy Silverado/ GMC Sierra 1500 with 6'7\" bed of 2007 2008 2009 2010 2011 2012 2013 (DO NOT FIT Multi-flex tailgate)\nEasy Installation: No tools or drilling required; Upgraded clamps with adjustable holes allow for an easy installation within 20 minutes; user friendly design for easy assembly and dis-assembly\nWhy Quad Fold: More access room when folded up, more durable with one more cross bar and two more firm clamps than trifold cover\nSafety First: Reinforced corner design keeps the cover tight to the bed; sturdy clamps and buckles with straps protect the cover from sliding or blowing off while driving\nAll season Protection: Features tear resistant, water resistance, high temperature resistance, no matter where you are or what the weather is like, we’ve got you covered",
